    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PAM: She said you should do it in honour of her grandparents.\nMARIA: Siegmund and Malvina. She had the most beautiful eyes, like an owl.",
      "MARIA: Maybe you should change lanes.\nPAM: With pleasure, Mrs. Altmann.",
      "MARIA: I wasn’t going to miss the fun part. It’s like a James Bond film and you are Sean Connery.\nANNA: Hello, I’m Anna. It’s an honour to meet you.",
      "MARIA: It really isn’t much of an inconvenience. If I wasn’t here, I’d either be at my shop or at home watching ‘Days of Our Lives’.\nJUDGE COOPER: I’m glad to hear that, Mrs. Altmann. But from now on, would you mind speaking only when you are asked? There are certain procedures which ne…",
      "MARIA: Like you have spiders crawling in your underwear all the time.\nPAM: Sweetie, will you stop looking at your watch every two minutes?\nMARIA: You’re making us all nervous."
    ]
